---
permalink: /en/sostenibilidad/certificaciones/
title: "Certifications & awards"
description: "Green Destinations, Marca Perú, SERNANP, Por la Conservación, ESNNA and more: the certifications and awards behind Ecocruceros."
---
{% set t = i18n[lang] %}

<nav class="container breadcrumbs" aria-label="breadcrumb" style="padding-top:var(--space-8)"><a href="/en/">Home</a><span>›</span><a href="/en/sostenibilidad/">Sustainability</a><span>›</span> Certifications</nav>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:var(--space-8)">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Certifications</p>
    <h1>Credentials you can verify</h1>
    <p class="lead">We don't use stamps as decoration: each certification has a meaning.</p>
    <div class="cert-grid" style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">
      {% for c in site.certs %}
      <div class="cert">
        {% if c.verify %}
        <a class="cert__link" href="{{ c.verify }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Verify: {{ c.name }} (opens in a new tab)">
          <div class="cert__logo"><img src="/assets/img/certs/{{ c.img }}" alt="{{ c.name }}" loading="lazy" width="88" height="88"></div>
          <b>{{ c.name }}</b>
          <span class="cert__verify">Verify →</span>
        </a>
        {% else %}
        <div class="cert__logo"><img src="/assets/img/certs/{{ c.img }}" alt="{{ c.name }}" loading="lazy" width="88" height="88"></div>
        <b>{{ c.name }}</b>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--sky">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">CALTUR seal — MINCETUR</p>
    <h2>Good practices recognised by the State</h2>
    <p class="lead">Through the CALTUR Good Practices system, Peru's Ministry of Foreign Trade and Tourism (MINCETUR) recognises Ecocruceros in two operating categories. Valid through December 2026.</p>
    <div class="grid cols-2" style="margin-top:var(--space-6)">
      <div class="card card--top"><div class="card__body"><h3>Aquatic tourist transport</h3><p>Recognition for applying good management practices in the travel-agency service that operates <strong>aquatic tourist transport</strong>.</p></div></div>
      <div class="card card--top"><div class="card__body"><h3>Marine wildlife watching</h3><p>Recognition for applying good management practices in the travel-agency service that operates <strong>marine wildlife watching</strong>.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--warm">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Recognition</p>
    <h2>Awards & press</h2>
    <div class="grid cols-2" style="margin-top:var(--space-6)">
      <div class="card"><div class="card__body"><h3>FIASEET 2024 award — Sustainable Tourism</h3><p><strong>2nd place</strong> in the 3rd Best Practices in Sustainable Tourism &amp; SDGs competition ("towards a generation of equality"), run by the International Federation of Associations of Women Tourism Executives (FIASEET) and its Sustainable Tourism Committee (COMTUS). Members category · October 2024.</p></div></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="card__body"><h3>PromPerú</h3><p>Featured our Palomino Islands tours (2025). <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jBhNrgPsMN8" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch the video →</a></p></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card" style="margin-top:var(--space-6)"><div class="card__body"><h3>Reviews</h3><p>4.9★ on GetYourGuide, Tripadvisor and Google Reviews. <a href="{{ site.tripadvisor.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">See Tripadvisor profile →</a></p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
